Not necessarily good, bad, but that's

00:25:48.080 --> 00:25:50.960
what, you know, we in Andover, we have a

00:25:51.840 --> 00:25:55.520
large senior population and it's continuing to grow.

00:25:57.520 --> 00:25:58.160
This

00:25:58.560 --> 00:26:02.045
is the slide in our affordable housing plan that

00:26:02.525 --> 00:26:07.565
really got my attention. And it showed that between 2010

00:26:08.125 --> 00:26:09.565
and 2020,

00:26:09.725 --> 00:26:13.005
Andover's population declined by four and a half percent.

00:26:13.960 --> 00:26:17.320
