And I said, well, that's probably not good for

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:25.320
our tax base, you know, and

00:26:25.800 --> 00:26:28.360
all that stuff. There might be

00:26:29.455 --> 00:26:30.015
a

00:26:30.495 --> 00:26:32.015
