You know, families are getting smaller,

00:26:35.375 --> 00:26:38.095
as we're getting older, we've got a lot of empty nesters.

00:26:39.775 --> 00:26:41.135
But a decreasing,

00:26:41.135 --> 00:26:42.735
declining population,

00:26:42.735 --> 00:26:43.935
I don't think

00:26:44.270 --> 00:26:45.710
