00:26:46.910 --> 00:26:49.550
And then we went, you know, and I looked at

00:26:50.110 --> 00:26:54.910
a website called the Connecticut Data Center and they're the group

00:26:55.950 --> 00:27:00.705
that the state uses to analyze all the census data and all that stuff.

