The pandemic and the shifting to

00:28:38.070 --> 00:28:40.070
virtual working may

00:28:40.310 --> 00:28:44.390
result in Andover's population turning around and going back up.

00:28:44.630 --> 00:28:48.230
But right this minute, the state of Connecticut population is increasing,

00:28:48.310 --> 00:28:49.670
Andover's going down,

00:28:49.990 --> 00:28:53.030
and we ought to see what we can do

00:28:53.395 --> 00:28:55.155
to keep our town healthy.

00:28:55.955 --> 00:28:56.995
So that's my

00:28:58.195 --> 00:29:00.275
pitch on the population

00:29:01.795 --> 00:29:02.675
stuff.

